We were hot.
我们当时很热。

376
00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.600
And I remember being so excited after lunch.
我记得午饭后我特别兴奋。

377
00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:10.300
Didn't you guys have to turn the air off when we were filming?
你们当时拍戏的时候是不是得把空调关掉？

378
00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.220
Because it was loud.
因为声音太大了。

379
