The AC in the bus was loud.
巴士里的空调声音很大。

380
00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:13.520
Yes.
是的。

381
00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:14.340
It was loud.
声音很大。

382
00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.640
So there was this announcement.
