We have a portable AC unit that we're going to pull on a trailer behind the bus.
我们有一个便携式空调机组，会用拖车拉在巴士后面。

385
00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:30.100
And we have a hose that is going to go up through like this sunroof thing in the bus.
我们还有一根软管，会穿过巴士上的天窗之类的东西。

386
00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:30.340
Yeah.
对。

387
00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.160
And it'll be quiet.
这样就很安静了。

388
00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.300
We can leave it on while we're filming.
我们拍戏的时候可以一直开着它。

389
00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.840
You guys aren't going to be hot anymore.
你们以后就不会再觉得热了。

390
00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.620
And we couldn't believe our luck.
我们简直不敢相信自己的运气。

391
00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:37.040
Yeah.
是啊。

392
00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:37.960
We were so excited.
我们当时太兴奋了。

393
00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:38.800
Beautiful.
太美好了。

394
00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.880
This is fresh, wonderful, cool air.
这是新鲜、美妙、凉爽的空气。

395
00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.300
People were getting wilty.
大家当时都快蔫了。

396
00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:43.020
They were getting.
他们当时。

397
00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:43.240
Yeah.
是啊。

398
00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.640
So we were like in a hot tin can.
我们就像待在一个滚烫的铁皮罐头里。

399
00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:45.200
It was.
确实是。

400
00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:45.400
Yeah.
是啊。

401
00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:46.100
It was really tough.
那真的太难熬了。

402
00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.520
And San Fernando Valley, like you said, it was 100 degrees.
而且就像你说的，圣费尔南多谷当时有100华氏度（约38摄氏度）。

403
00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:48.880
Yeah.
是啊。

404
00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:57.660
And then we made it worse by having the closed up windows and everything else to where the heat inside that bus.
我们还把车窗都关上，让情况变得更糟，车厢里的热度简直……

