Oh, God.
天哪。

406
00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.360
I would think would be 110, 115.
我觉得得有110、115华氏度（约43-46摄氏度）。

407
00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:03.420
It was like a little sauna rolling down the road.
就像个在路上滚动的桑拿房。

408
00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.360
