我们当时还在尝试早点拍。

409
00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:07.840
Every time we cut, they'd try to pump the air.
每次一喊停，他们就试着开空调。

410
00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:08.480
Yeah.
是啊。

411
00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.460
But then we'd have to turn it off.
但之后我们又得关掉。

412
00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:13.900
And you'd only be able to work for about five, 10 minutes before it became unbearable.
每次只能拍个五到十分钟，就热得受不了了。

413
00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.040
So we got the little rolly unit.
所以我们弄了个小型移动空调。

414
00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.720
A brilliant idea.
真是个天才的主意。

415
00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:18.120
Yeah.
是啊。

416
00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.300
It was so wonderful.
太棒了。

417
00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:27.460
But then we started moving and my chair was right under the little sunroof.
但后来车子开动了，我的椅子正好在那个小天窗下面。

418
00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.360
I was very excited.
我当时特别兴奋。

419
00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.700
I was like, this is awesome.
我心想，这太赞了。

420
00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:30.460
You're going to get all the air.
你能吹到所有的冷风。

421
00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.460
I'm going to get the first amazing cool air.
我能第一个享受到那阵美妙的冷风。

422
00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:33.880
Yes.
没错。

423
00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.320
But I.
但是……

424
00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.080
And you did.
你确实享受到了。

425
00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:37.400
I sure did.
我确实享受到了。

426
