To be fair, I was the person on the set who had all the allergies and I was ruining
平心而论，我是片场那个过敏最严重的人，我总是因为打喷嚏毁掉拍摄。

442
00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.700
takes from sneezing all the time.
我想大家可能觉得那只是珍娜的过敏性鼻炎，珍娜比较敏感。

443
00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:15.360
And I think people thought it was just Jenna's allergy nose, Jenna's sensitive.
但我当时就说，不，不，不。

444
00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:16.860
And I was like, no, no, no.
不是那回事。

445
00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.780
It's not that.
那是汽油味。

446
00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:18.960
It's like gas.
然后莎拉，我们的摄影师，她当时就站在你后面，她说……

447
00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.620
And then Sarah, our camera operator who was standing back there by you, she was like,
