448
00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:23.920
I wasn't.
她当时有点头晕。

449
00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.340
She got a little woozy.
是啊。

450
00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:25.860
Yeah.
是啊。

