00:19:56.500 --> 00:20:02.480
It was a great, great idea, but the execution was not thoroughly thought through.
这主意确实很棒，但执行起来没考虑周全。

465
00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:08.260
So what we came up with when we realized in production meeting was saying, well, it's
