00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:40.520
There was no possibility of avoiding this.
而且它已经固定死了。

492
00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:41.840
And it was locked down.
但我们直到车子开动之后才发现。

493
00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:45.000
But we didn't realize that until we were actually underway.
当时设备已经启动了。

494
00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.420
And the thing was fired up.
说真的，珍娜，是你那灵敏的鼻子救了我们的命。

