00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:53.620
When we had the, when we all went flying into one another, I believe I flew into Leslie.
当我们大家撞在一起的时候，我想我是撞到了莱斯利。

523
00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:58.320
Did Leslie, when we got off, I remember he was like, I'm not getting back on.
莱斯利当时……我们下来的时候，我记得他说，我再也不上去了。

524
00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:00.800
Leslie said, I'm never getting back on the bus again.
莱斯利说，我再也不会上那辆车了。

525
00:23:00.800 --> 00:23:01.340
I'm done.
我受够了。

526
00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:02.340
I'm done getting on the bus.
我再也不上车了。

527
00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:06.640
I remember him walking to his car and driving away, but I think that might not be true.
我记得他走向自己的车然后开车离开了，但我觉得这可能不是真的。

528
00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:09.720
But for some reason, I remember Leslie was like, goodbye.
但不知为何，我记得莱斯利当时就像是说，再见。

529
00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:10.720
I'm out.
我不干了。

530
00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:11.300
I'm out.
我不干了。

531
00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:12.120
Shoot around me.
别拍我。

532
00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:16.500
But also, poor Leslie, whenever we went on locations, he got the worst of it.
而且，可怜的莱斯利，每次我们去外景地，他总是最倒霉的那个。

533
00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:21.760
When we went to the beach, he got sand kicked in his eye and it scratched his cornea.
我们去海滩时，沙子踢进了他的眼睛，划伤了他的角膜。

534
00:23:21.760 --> 00:23:24.140
And he had to wear, like, a patch for a week.
他不得不戴了一个星期的眼罩。

535
00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:24.380
Yeah.
是啊。

536
00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:25.100
Oof.
哎哟。

537
00:23:25.100 --> 00:23:28.980
So, I think Leslie was like, I don't do scenes outside of the office anymore.
所以，我想莱斯利当时的态度就是，我再也不拍办公室以外的戏了。

538
00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:29.680
Forget it.
算了吧。

539
00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:30.400
Forget it.
算了吧。

540
00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.220
I don't go on location.
我不去外景地。

541
00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.260
Shit goes down.
总会出事。

542
00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.960
It almost sounds like his character.
听起来简直就像他演的角色一样。

543
00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:36.060
You just drill.
