00:26:08.960 --> 00:26:10.040
It's just so great.
真是太棒了。

585
00:26:10.200 --> 00:26:12.140
And everyone is just like, oh, whatever.
而大家只是觉得，哦，无所谓。

586
00:26:12.400 --> 00:26:14.540
Well, no, and it's true.
嗯，不，这是真的。

587
00:26:14.620 --> 00:26:16.440
I taught him the banjo in two weeks.
我教了他两周班卓琴。

588
00:26:16.700 --> 00:26:20.540
