00:26:35.140 --> 00:26:36.340
Look how happy you were.
看看你当时有多开心。

602
00:26:36.380 --> 00:26:37.520
Well, he remembered that.
嗯，他记得那个。

603
00:26:37.660 --> 00:26:38.500
Wasn't that one?
那不是其中一个吗？

604
00:26:38.920 --> 00:26:39.180
Yeah.
