因为那个名字太搞笑了。

606
00:26:41.140 --> 00:26:41.700
I like it.
我喜欢。

607
00:26:41.940 --> 00:26:42.380
Yeah.
是啊。

608
00:26:42.520 --> 00:26:47.340
There was like a, it was like a, I think it was gooseberry because it wasn't blackberry.
