00:27:42.660 --> 00:27:43.140
questions.
这样的问题。

630
00:27:43.520 --> 00:27:46.580
What was one of the first jobs you had in entertainment?
你刚入行时做过的工作有哪些？

631
00:27:47.540 --> 00:27:53.160
One of the first jobs I had in entertainment, I think it was a soap opera.
我刚入行时做的工作，我想应该是部肥皂剧。

632
00:27:53.520 --> 00:27:58.100
I did like a three-day role on Days of Our Lives.
我在《我们的日子》里演过一个三天的角色。

633
00:27:58.100 --> 00:28:00.100
I love Days of Our Lives.
我超爱《我们的日子》。

634
00:28:00.760 --> 00:28:03.320
Back in 1981.
那是1981年的事了。

635
00:28:04.800 --> 00:28:06.120
